  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipal Infrastructure Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The initial main objective of the Action, before its repurposing in 2022 after the start of the full scale Russian military aggression) was to set up the sustainable infrastructure in Kharkiv Oblast (Kharkiv, the cities of Bogodukhiv and Chuguev) in the eastern part of Ukraine. The project consists of rehabilitation and construction of water supply infrastructure in the cities of Bogodukhiv and Chuguev along with Technical Assistance for project implementation and capacity building. After repurposing, the Action &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; aims at rehabilitating existing water supply and wastewater infrastructure in Chernivtsi by this also strengthening Chernivtsi as receiving community of IDPs. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
